        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia AP-9040, Ridged Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Ridged Appliance Pull is a great way to give your refrigerator a homey touch. Its simplicity gives this appliance pull an elegance. It is available in either a 12 inch or a 18 inch length. Choose from 6 finishes including oil rubbed bronze (pictured right), satin nickel, and polished brass.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/traditional-ridged-cabinet-pull-omnia-9040\"><b>Traditional Ridged Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/large-traditional-ridged-cabinet-pull-omnia-9040\"><b>Larger Traditional Ridged Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Ridged Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9040/305</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-21/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 15/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>9040/458</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-25/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 15/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNeed this in a smaller size? <a href=\"/products/traditional-ridged-cabinet-pull-omnia-9040\"><b>click here</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/lion-head-door-stop.jpg?v=1704354585\" width=\"514\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
